# X Y R G B A TOL LABEL   (RGBA in the UI target, premultiplied)
# blur(16px) over a hard black | white edge at x = 720: 16 px either side of the edge is about 16% and 84% grey, never the sharp 0 and 255
704 400 41 41 41 255 32 left of the edge, blurred
736 400 214 214 214 255 32 right of the edge, blurred
720 400 128 128 128 255 24 on the edge
# the panel is opaque inside and empty outside, rounded at the corners
540 320 0 0 0 255 6 inside the panel (the scene is black there)
700 250 0 0 0 0 1 above the panel
522 302 0 0 0 0 2 rounded corner
# brightness(0.5) alone over the white side
1100 650 128 128 128 255 10 half brightness
